From 0638d9c9f180d26bc43a2683bdf57e08cba342d0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nova <361320585+q2-nova@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 03:29:15 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] MIPS: ingenic: add X2000 CCU SMP bring-up

Adapt the Ingenic-community SMP approach by Paul Burton and Zhou Yanjie
(reference revision 91fe78280ac7dd0dae0f58cb271e821bd39ba97e), retaining
their copyright notices, with the Q2 vendor CCU reset/mailbox registers.
The vendor SDK reference is DiamondBond/q2-kernel at
655f42c032402719881ff2a1b801bd797dc514c1.

Both CPUs boot, execute userspace and receive mailbox interrupts in QEMU.
CPU hotplug and cache coherency on physical hardware remain unvalidated.
